93", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Anderson & Krathwohl 2001", "full_reference": "Anderson, Lorin W. & Krathwohl, David R. (toim.). 2001: A taxonomy for learning, teaching, and assessing: A revision of Bloom\u2019s taxonomy of educational objectives. New York: Longman.", "concept_context": "4.5 T\u00e4ydent\u00e4v\u00e4t tieteelliset menetelm\u00e4t: Psykometrinen tarkkuus ja muodollinen todentaminen"}}, "550": {"id": "17c6005f-5542-4756-8a65-b98f87da6585", "job_id": "e581d13c-9eb9-4ed2-9f0a-07bd547f3792", "type": "claim", "term": "Anderson & Krathwohl 2001; Toulmin 2003...", "definition": "Se hy\u00f6dynt\u00e4\u00e4 Bloomin taksonomiaa kognitiivisten taitotasojen (analyysi, arviointi, synteesi) erittelyyn ja Toulminin argumentaatiomallia p\u00e4\u00e4ttelyn laadun systemaattiseen arviointiin.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "ingested_at": "2025-12-27T14:24:20.486102", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Anderson & Krathwohl 2001; Toulmin 2003", "full_reference": "Anderson, Lorin W. & Krathwohl, David R. (toim.). 2001: A taxonomy for learning, teaching, and assessing: A revision of Bloom\u2019s taxonomy of educational objectives. New York: Longman.", "concept_context": "2.2.1 Analyyttinen Taso: Kognitiivinen Arviointimatriisi"}}, "551": {"id": "0c76e44d-d527-4fb3-982a-a8c68b247550", "job_id": "e581d13c-9eb9-4ed2-9f0a-07bd547f3792", "type": "claim", "term": "Smith & Kendall 1963...", "definition": "Behaviorally Anchored Rating Scales), joka sitoo arviointitasot konkreettisiin kuvauksiin.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "ingested_at": "2025-12-27T14:24:20.493420", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Smith & Kendall 1963", "full_reference": "Smith, Patricia Cain & Kendall, Lorne M. 1963: Retranslation of expectations: An approach to the construction of unambiguous anchors for rating scales. Journal of Applied Psychology, 47(2), 149\u2013155. DOI: 10.1037/h0047060.", "concept_context": "2